     "excerpt": "The current draft preserves regulator access to complete per-model results, provides numerical results to customers, and retains regulator authority to require corrective action or restrict sales where a model presents unreasonable risk. The 8% cap is our proposed workable limit. With the model-specific recall trigger at 10/100,000 and the existing safety safeguards, we ask Halcyon to sign this version so the standard can be adopted.",
